WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:58.655
Subtitles Uploade by : Inyonk

2
00:02:58.655 --> 00:02:59.574
Wow. Juhi Chawla!

3
00:03:01.574 --> 00:03:06.655
I have to go to shooting
and my car is in trouble.

4
00:03:07.655 --> 00:03:09.854
Can you give me lift?

5
00:03:09.854 --> 00:03:13.895
Yes, I mean no, I mean definitely.

6
00:03:13.895 --> 00:03:15.535
Come. Please come.

7
00:03:16.535 --> 00:03:20.175
I am so lucky that I got you.

8
00:03:21.175 --> 00:03:23.535
I can't forget your help
for the rest of my life.

9
00:03:23.535 --> 00:03:26.935
What help! This was my duty, madam.

10
00:03:26.935 --> 00:03:31.455
How sweet! We don't get people
like you these days. - O God.

11
00:03:35.455 --> 00:03:37.014
Madam is here.
- Bring some tea for her.

12
00:03:38.014 --> 00:03:39.974
Keep this aside. Turn on the light.

13
00:03:40.974 --> 00:03:42.574
Bye, bye.

14
00:03:43.574 --> 00:03:45.255
Thank you. - Mention not.

15
00:03:46.255 --> 00:03:48.255
Bring a glass of water. - Listen.

16
00:03:50.255 --> 00:03:51.455
Can you meet me again?

17
00:03:54.455 --> 00:03:56.414
O God! - Hurry up.

18
00:03:57.414 --> 00:04:00.375
Miss. Juhi,
why did you call me so suddenly?

19
00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:04.735
Just like that.
I felt like meeting you. - I see.

20
00:04:05.735 --> 00:04:09.654
This place is so romantic,
isn't it? - Yes.

21
00:04:20.654 --> 00:04:23.214
Sometimes I feel that
if didn't had the help of..

22
00:04:23.214 --> 00:04:26.935
..these strong arms,
what would have happened to me?

23
00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:32.894
Promise me that you
will always be with me.

24
00:04:33.894 --> 00:04:35.175
What are you saying, Miss. Juhi!

25
00:04:35.175 --> 00:04:39.134
Not Miss.
Juhi, call me just Juhi. - Wow.

26
00:04:42.134 --> 00:04:43.014
Juhi.

27
00:04:45.014 --> 00:04:47.735
Hey, come here. - Wow. Govinda.

28
00:04:47.735 --> 00:04:52.095
Who are you?
- Govinda, meet him, he is Mr. Amar.

29
00:04:53.095 --> 00:04:56.535
I told you about him..
- I see, so he is the person..

30
00:04:56.535 --> 00:04:59.055
..who helped you at each step.
Very amusing.

31
00:05:00.055 --> 00:05:02.694
You are a very good-looking person.
- Thank you.

32
00:05:02.694 --> 00:05:04.095
You choice have improved.

33
00:05:06.095 --> 00:05:10.574
Excuse me.
- She is a shy girl. And listen..

34
00:05:10.574 --> 00:05:13.334
You are so good-looking,
why don't you give a try in films?

35
00:05:13.334 --> 00:05:19.095
Hi. - I got many offers,
but I am very choosy.

36
00:05:25.095 --> 00:05:28.935
Take 21, action. - Come and hug me.

37
00:05:28.935 --> 00:05:32.574
No, Gopal. This can't happen.
- Why can't this happen?

38
00:05:32.574 --> 00:05:34.375
This because you
are rich and I am poor.

39
00:05:37.375 --> 00:05:38.894
Come and give me a hug.

40
00:05:38.894 --> 00:05:40.454
But Gopal, try to understand..

41
00:05:40.454 --> 00:05:42.815
..the helplessness of a woman.
- What's that?

42
00:05:46.815 --> 00:05:49.855
This won't let us live
and this is the truth.

43
00:05:49.855 --> 00:05:52.055
The truth is that you love
me the truth is that I love you.

44
00:05:53.055 --> 00:05:53.574
This is the truth
and everything is a lie.

45
00:05:54.574 --> 00:05:55.014
Remember this and forget everything.

46
00:05:56.014 --> 00:05:59.055
Come and give me a hug.
- Govinda! Get closer.

47
00:06:06.055 --> 00:06:10.415
What's happened?
- I thought Shahrukh Khan came.

48
00:06:10.415 --> 00:06:13.415
Shit. Shahrukh Khan,
Govinda, Sunny Deol..

49
00:06:13.415 --> 00:06:15.415
Your life consists of just this.
I heard that you are doing..

50
00:06:16.415 --> 00:06:18.615
..many films,
a bit more than required.

51
00:06:19.615 --> 00:06:23.014
Yes, people like our pair.

52
00:06:24.014 --> 00:06:28.894
And you?
- Me too. He is very handsome.

53
00:06:29.894 --> 00:06:32.055
Why? Are you feeling jealous?

54
00:06:33.055 --> 00:06:36.935
I fear that I won't kill anyone.
- Amar. Did you get angry?

55
00:06:37.935 --> 00:06:42.454
I was just kidding.
You are everything to me.

56
00:06:42.454 --> 00:06:44.975
You are my dear one.

57
00:06:44.975 --> 00:06:48.855
Yes, Amar.
I am unable to live without you now.

58
00:06:49.855 --> 00:06:52.214
Come, let's go somewhere
and get married.

59
00:06:53.214 --> 00:06:55.375
I will leave the film line for you.

60
00:06:55.375 --> 00:06:57.735
No, you need to leave the film line.

61
00:06:57.735 --> 00:07:00.694
You continue it. I am with you.
I will take care of everything

62
00:07:00.694 --> 00:07:04.255
I will handle everything.
And I will also select your heroes.

63
00:07:04.255 --> 00:07:05.574
And stay a bit away from them.

64
00:07:06.574 --> 00:07:11.334
Amar, how sweet! - Juhi, my darling.

65
00:07:12.334 --> 00:07:15.214
In front of the God,
I accept you as my husband..

66
00:07:15.214 --> 00:07:17.055
..from the bottom of my heart.

67
00:07:21.055 --> 00:07:23.975
Me too, in front of the God,
I accept you as my wife..

68
00:07:23.975 --> 00:07:25.415
..from the bottom of my
heart along with your money.

69
00:07:29.415 --> 00:07:32.855
What's this, father?
You spoiled my dream.

70
00:07:32.855 --> 00:07:34.894
I was about to put the
garland on the heroine..

71
00:07:34.894 --> 00:07:36.975
..and came right then.
Couldn't you come a few minutes later?

72
00:07:36.975 --> 00:07:38.214
Stop the nuisance
and get up from here.

73
00:07:39.214 --> 00:07:40.334
You are sleeping
on the cashier's seat!

74
00:07:41.334 --> 00:07:42.855
I told you many times not the..

75
00:07:42.855 --> 00:07:43.014
..let his near the money box.

76
00:07:44.014 --> 00:07:46.535
I actually..
- What's there in you box! A beggar..

77
00:07:46.535 --> 00:07:49.815
..in Bombay earns more
than what you have in this box.

78
00:07:50.815 --> 00:07:54.214
Babulal, be careful. Don't
cut his ear like you did yesterday.

79
00:07:54.214 --> 00:07:56.694
Brother, be careful.
- Who can there be notes in this box?

80
00:07:56.694 --> 00:07:58.815
Yesterday, you took 100
rupees note from this box.

81
00:07:58.815 --> 00:08:02.175
I actually spent it. I got
my hair cut with Rosy's soft hands..

82
00:08:03.175 --> 00:08:05.855
..in Taj Mahal hotel's saloon. - What!

83
00:08:05.855 --> 00:08:09.134
I earn that money
after doing 20 haircuts..

84
00:08:10.134 --> 00:08:12.975
..and you donated that
money to the Taj-people.

85
00:08:12.975 --> 00:08:14.415
And it seems that you
didn't even have the haircut.

86
00:08:14.415 --> 00:08:17.574
I had, but it doesn't appear.

87
00:08:17.574 --> 00:08:21.214
It's the latest French cut,
you see, lacupe force de hair.

88
00:08:21.214 --> 00:08:23.815
What's the matter,
you are talking in English?

89
00:08:23.815 --> 00:08:26.055
I have provided you with education..

90
00:08:27.055 --> 00:08:32.815
..and did everything for
you with the money I earned here.

91
00:08:32.815 --> 00:08:35.294
..and somehow I got
you admitted in the college.

92
00:08:35.294 --> 00:08:38.495
But what's the profit!
You were also thrown out of there.

93
00:08:38.495 --> 00:08:41.575
I wasn't thrown out father,
I left that college.

94
00:08:41.575 --> 00:08:44.294
Actually, the principal didn't
understand my views. - What!

95
00:08:45.294 --> 00:08:47.695
Actually, there are many ideas in me..

96
00:08:50.695 --> 00:08:52.654
..which are for the young generation,
for this country..

97
00:08:53.654 --> 00:08:55.294
..and especially for the fathers.

98
00:08:55.294 --> 00:08:58.335
According to me, till the fathers..

99
00:08:58.335 --> 00:08:59.695
..of this country won't be cured..

100
00:08:59.695 --> 00:09:01.054
..this country can't be develop.
The principal's son..

101
00:09:02.054 --> 00:09:04.975
..understood this,
but the principal couldn't and you..

102
00:09:05.975 --> 00:09:09.335
I'll shave you head right now.
- Father, what are you doing!

103
00:09:09.335 --> 00:09:12.414
If you'll shave my head,
people may think that are dead.

104
00:09:12.414 --> 00:09:15.855
Shut up, donkey.
- Please calm down, father.

105
00:09:15.855 --> 00:09:18.815
And listen to my idea.
I think we should sell this shop.

106
00:09:20.815 --> 00:09:25.534
I mean we can buy bangles'
shop with that money.

107
00:09:25.534 --> 00:09:28.855
Bangles' shop? - Yes, bangles' shop.

108
00:09:28.855 --> 00:09:29.615
Think about it.

109
00:09:30.615 --> 00:09:34.054
We will be surrounded with
beautiful ladies all the day.

110
00:09:35.054 --> 00:09:36.495
I will be dealing with the daughters..

111
00:09:37.495 --> 00:09:39.534
And you will be dealing
with the mothers.

112
00:09:42.534 --> 00:09:43.095
Somewhere there will
be the eye-contacts.

113
00:09:44.095 --> 00:09:45.815
Somewhere there will
be the blushing hair.

114
00:09:45.815 --> 00:09:47.575
And somewhere there will
be the adjustments in the sari.

115
00:09:49.575 --> 00:09:52.815
Their soft hands in your thick hands.

116
00:09:52.815 --> 00:09:55.215
And you are putting the
bangles with so much love.

117
00:09:58.215 --> 00:10:00.414
And you are doing ah,
ah, with naughtiness.

118
00:10:02.414 --> 00:10:05.014
Babulal, I told you
to cut the ears with care.

119
00:10:06.014 --> 00:10:08.095
This happened because of you.
- Because of me?

120
00:10:08.095 --> 00:10:12.095
Yes, because you are saying
all the rubbish. Get out.

121
00:10:15.095 --> 00:10:18.134
..but people respect me here.
- Is it so?

122
00:10:18.134 --> 00:10:18.575
You steal the money from my box.

123
00:10:19.575 --> 00:10:20.934
What are you doing here? Go away.

124
00:10:20.934 --> 00:10:22.014
You try to be a hero of this street.

125
00:10:23.014 --> 00:10:24.534
Father, right now you are very angry.

126
00:10:24.534 --> 00:10:25.894
I will explain this
to you in the evening.

127
00:10:25.894 --> 00:10:28.215
You will come again in the evening?
Shameless person!

128
00:10:28.215 --> 00:10:30.654
There won't be any other
worthless son in this world.

129
00:10:30.654 --> 00:10:32.695
There will be, father. There will be.

130
00:10:32.695 --> 00:10:35.495
There will a son like me,
where there will be a father like you.

131
00:10:40.495 --> 00:10:45.134
Bhola, today,
my left eye is shivering.

132
00:10:45.134 --> 00:10:47.575
It is a very good sign.

133
00:10:49.575 --> 00:10:53.575
I will get good news?
For me the last happy day..

134
00:10:57.575 --> 00:11:02.894
..from that day, my able son,
Prem didn't let me be happy.

135
00:11:02.894 --> 00:11:06.654
I earn and he spends. - Brother.

136
00:11:06.654 --> 00:11:08.414
Yes. - Whom are you scolding?

137
00:11:08.414 --> 00:11:11.215
I am my son,
but why did you come here?

138
00:11:11.215 --> 00:11:14.134
Did you forget,
you owe 500 rupees to Mr. Lala.

139
00:11:14.134 --> 00:11:18.255
What 500?
O no, I owe 500 rupees to Mr. Lala.

140
00:11:18.255 --> 00:11:23.134
Yes, I will give the money.
Here it is. Five crisp notes of 100.

141
00:11:25.134 --> 00:11:28.894
Prem has stolen it again.
- Why are you making excuses?

142
00:11:28.894 --> 00:11:31.575
That poor kid is in the Wah,
Wah studio.

143
00:11:31.575 --> 00:11:34.335
He is in the Wah, Wah Studio? - Yes.

144
00:11:34.335 --> 00:11:38.255
The filmy malaria Jonny,
you are robbing my son?

145
00:11:39.255 --> 00:11:43.534
The Jonny had shown the
dreams of films to my father..

146
00:11:43.534 --> 00:11:46.695
..and sent him to Bombay
and he never returned.

147
00:11:46.695 --> 00:11:50.455
In some movies he stood
like this is the crowd.

148
00:11:50.455 --> 00:11:54.095
This Jonny is fooling my son?
Where is my stick?

149
00:12:10.095 --> 00:12:15.695
Wow. What a face!

150
00:12:15.695 --> 00:12:17.975
You are one of a kind.

151
00:12:18.975 --> 00:12:21.855
What's this? - So that the
evil eye shouldn't fall on you.

152
00:12:22.855 --> 00:12:25.615
Sir, can I become a star?

153
00:12:25.615 --> 00:12:29.174
Can I become a star?
You are already a star. Lights off.

154
00:12:30.174 --> 00:12:32.855
Sir, now start the Wah,
Wah productions.

155
00:12:32.855 --> 00:12:36.255
It has already begun.
I have already talked to Amitabh.

156
00:12:36.255 --> 00:12:41.174
But me? - You will be the hero.
he will play your father's role.

157
00:12:42.174 --> 00:12:47.014
Is it ok with you? - Yes, definitely.

158
00:12:49.014 --> 00:12:50.455
Amitabh and me..

159
00:12:51.455 --> 00:12:52.294
Father and son..

160
00:12:53.294 --> 00:12:57.855
And a showdown between us!
Wow. What a scene!

161
00:12:57.855 --> 00:13:01.695
It's hot.
The Wah, Wah productions' tea.

162
00:13:01.695 --> 00:13:06.335
Here it is. - And bring a tea for sir.
And listen..

163
00:13:06.335 --> 00:13:08.695
Yes. - Subash Ghai was about to call.

164
00:13:08.695 --> 00:13:11.375
Yes, he will call is a moment.

165
00:13:12.375 --> 00:13:15.855
I gave your photos to Subash.

166
00:13:15.855 --> 00:13:19.654
He too wants a face
like yours for a new film.

167
00:13:19.654 --> 00:13:21.894
The Dracula's love story.

168
00:13:21.894 --> 00:13:23.215
Dracula's..

169
00:13:24.215 --> 00:13:28.375
This is Jonny from Wah,
Wah productions.

170
00:13:28.375 --> 00:13:31.455
Hello sir,
remember your promise of my role.

171
00:13:31.455 --> 00:13:36.414
Hello, Shubbu, yes.
It's Subash Ghai's call.

172
00:13:36.414 --> 00:13:39.975
Sir, convey my regards. - Ok, buddy..

173
00:13:39.975 --> 00:13:43.975
..tell me did you like the photos?

174
00:13:43.975 --> 00:13:44.414
They have created a stir in Bombay?

175
00:13:46.414 --> 00:13:49.455
The people over there liked
it so much? Very good, buddy.

176
00:13:50.455 --> 00:13:54.615
What! Non. Is it so?

177
00:13:58.615 --> 00:14:00.414
He showed your photos
to Madhuri Dixit.

178
00:14:01.414 --> 00:14:04.654
What does she say?
She will work just with him?

179
00:14:04.654 --> 00:14:07.815
She won't work with
anyone else? Great.

180
00:14:07.815 --> 00:14:13.495
She has also kept a photo.
Very good. Non.

181
00:14:20.495 --> 00:14:23.014
There are two heroines in the film.
They also talked to Juhi..

182
00:14:24.014 --> 00:14:26.095
She took your address.
She is coming here to meet you.

183
00:14:27.095 --> 00:14:29.134
Are two heroines ok with you?
- Definitely.

184
00:14:29.134 --> 00:14:32.975
Definitely, it will work.

185
00:14:32.975 --> 00:14:37.455
Get up, buddy. You work is done.

186
00:14:37.455 --> 00:14:39.014
It's done. There it is done.

187
00:14:40.014 --> 00:14:43.255
Wah, Wah Productions is in trouble.

188
00:14:43.255 --> 00:14:47.215
The laundry-man is saying
that if he doesn't get his Rs. 500..

189
00:14:47.215 --> 00:14:49.934
He will take away the camera.

190
00:14:50.934 --> 00:14:52.575
I am trying to give new
artists to the industry..

191
00:14:53.575 --> 00:14:56.335
..and here they are trying
to take away my camera?

192
00:14:56.335 --> 00:14:59.615
He can take away the camera,
but not his destiny.

193
00:14:59.615 --> 00:15:01.695
Give him the camera. - Stop.

194
00:15:01.695 --> 00:15:03.375
He wants to give the money. Give him.

195
00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:06.335
Take this and throw this on this face.

196
00:15:06.335 --> 00:15:09.534
I will throw you out of here.

197
00:15:09.534 --> 00:15:12.975
You are donating my
hard-earned money to this fool?

198
00:15:12.975 --> 00:15:15.014
Father, he will make me the hero.
- Will he?

199
00:15:16.014 --> 00:15:17.815
He couldn't become
even a peon himself.

200
00:15:17.815 --> 00:15:21.455
I will also make you
the hero in my film, uncle.

201
00:15:21.455 --> 00:15:25.414
Uncle. You are a very old-timer.

202
00:15:28.414 --> 00:15:32.495
Listen to me carefully.
If you try to fool my foolish son..

203
00:15:32.495 --> 00:15:36.735
..then I will put the needle
in this ear and take it out..

204
00:15:36.735 --> 00:15:40.534
..from that ear.
I will punish you hard.

205
00:15:40.534 --> 00:15:42.095
I will make you a deaf man.

206
00:15:42.095 --> 00:15:46.335
Father, whatever you may
say I will become something.

207
00:15:46.335 --> 00:15:49.134
Greetings, sir. - You fool,
take the scissor in the hands..

208
00:15:49.134 --> 00:15:53.215
..and start sewing.
- Father, I can't do that.

209
00:15:53.215 --> 00:15:56.134
You can't do that?
Then, can you hold a beggar's bowl?

210
00:15:56.134 --> 00:16:00.414
No, father. Father, I can
see my destination in front of me.

211
00:16:00.414 --> 00:16:02.975
In front of you, there is
a police-station and graveyard.

212
00:16:02.975 --> 00:16:04.975
Tell me which one is your destination?

213
00:16:04.975 --> 00:16:10.894
Father, how should I tell you,
my stars is about to shine.

214
00:16:13.894 --> 00:16:17.095
Welcome madam. - Thank you.

215
00:16:17.095 --> 00:16:18.654
Welcome madam..
- It is nice to see you here.

216
00:16:18.654 --> 00:16:21.855
Enough. Stop it, please.
It's too much.

217
00:16:21.855 --> 00:16:24.095
Is it true that you
came to India to marry?

218
00:16:25.095 --> 00:16:28.414
Right, I came here to marry.
What's so surprising in it?

219
00:16:28.414 --> 00:16:31.855
The daughter of such a rich person,
Ram Gopal Bajaj..

220
00:16:31.855 --> 00:16:35.375
..Miss. Raveena.
You have seen the whole world.

221
00:16:35.375 --> 00:16:37.615
Then why did you
choose India for this?

222
00:16:37.615 --> 00:16:39.375
I mean why did you
choose Indian man for this?

223
00:16:39.375 --> 00:16:43.414
The thing is that people
here love the love so much.

224
00:16:43.414 --> 00:16:48.375
Yes. - I mean they don't deal
with head, but with their heart.

225
00:16:48.375 --> 00:16:50.335
I too want such a crazy lover.

226
00:16:50.335 --> 00:16:51.335
- You will definitely get one..

227
00:16:51.335 --> 00:16:52.815
Because this country
is full of crazy people.

228
00:16:52.815 --> 00:16:55.335
You will search one,
and you will get thousands.

229
00:16:55.335 --> 00:16:56.735
You naughty man.

230
00:17:00.735 --> 00:17:04.454
Madam, did you say anything?
Did you hear anything?

231
00:17:04.454 --> 00:17:06.734
We haven't heard anything.
- No, I haven't said anything.

232
00:17:06.734 --> 00:17:09.654
Is it wrong if I say something?
- Yes, madam.

233
00:17:11.654 --> 00:17:13.934
They will understand a little
and they'll write many things.

234
00:17:13.934 --> 00:17:15.015
They will write something
here and something else will print.

235
00:17:16.015 --> 00:17:17.615
And whatever will be printed
will be something else.

236
00:17:18.615 --> 00:17:20.055
And that something else
will be really something else.

237
00:17:21.055 --> 00:17:23.815
Correct. - Yes,
there will be something else.

238
00:17:23.815 --> 00:17:26.894
Mr. Something! Who are you?

239
00:17:26.894 --> 00:17:30.214
She is Karishma,
my - Secretary - Cum - Friend.

240
00:17:30.214 --> 00:17:32.654
Cum. - Adviser. - Cum. - Attendant.

241
00:17:32.654 --> 00:17:35.335
Cum. - Cook. - Hold on..

242
00:17:35.335 --> 00:17:38.134
What if you get two persons at a time,
one with a big heart..

243
00:17:38.134 --> 00:17:40.454
..and one with good of brain.
Then what will you do?

244
00:17:42.454 --> 00:17:46.494
I will reject both.
- Because my madam likes a person..

245
00:17:46.494 --> 00:17:48.855
..who has a bit of heart..
- And a bit of brain.

246
00:17:48.855 --> 00:17:50.335
Right. - Right.

247
00:17:53.335 --> 00:17:57.615
Isn't your master Rustam here?
This is stinking.

248
00:17:58.615 --> 00:18:01.055
How are you Amar? - Brother Ahmen,
the strike didn't end?

249
00:18:02.055 --> 00:18:04.375
Non. - Buddy,
I can't understand the government's..

250
00:18:04.375 --> 00:18:06.575
..policies.
- Whatever these leaders do..

251
00:18:07.575 --> 00:18:12.974
..we have to bear the loses.
- I think I should do something, Okay.

252
00:18:17.974 --> 00:18:18.335
The credit-master is gone.

253
00:18:20.335 --> 00:18:22.815
Are you new! Switch on the fan.

254
00:18:23.815 --> 00:18:26.454
This old-model thing
can fall at any given moment.

255
00:18:26.454 --> 00:18:30.454
London's beauty in India?
- In search of a husband.

256
00:18:30.454 --> 00:18:33.214
She looks gorgeous.
She is just like a heroine.

257
00:18:33.214 --> 00:18:36.694
Wow. She came to India for a groom.
Read further.

258
00:18:36.694 --> 00:18:40.255
He who marries her
will get 50 crores..

259
00:18:41.255 --> 00:18:43.414
And also two factories in London.

260
00:18:43.414 --> 00:18:45.255
And also the diamond
factory in Switzerland.

261
00:18:45.255 --> 00:18:50.375
And there is also a farmhouse.
- She is a lottery ticket.

262
00:18:50.375 --> 00:18:53.974
Hey, stop it.
This news is for me. - For you?

263
00:18:53.974 --> 00:18:58.174
Yes, she is my heroine. - Am I dead!

264
00:18:58.174 --> 00:19:02.535
She came to India just for me.
- Wow, my lion.

265
00:19:02.535 --> 00:19:08.214
You go there for once and
trap her like I trapped you.

266
00:19:08.214 --> 00:19:10.894
I mean the way I made you the hero.

267
00:19:11.894 --> 00:19:15.375
You go and trap her and then our Wah,
Wah productions..

268
00:19:15.375 --> 00:19:20.174
..will become
international productions.

269
00:19:20.174 --> 00:19:23.414
And we will make movies in English.

270
00:19:23.414 --> 00:19:25.575
English know you?
- Walk English, talk English.

271
00:19:26.575 --> 00:19:29.694
Finish. - But we may
need lot of money for this.

272
00:19:29.694 --> 00:19:33.535
No problem. You will get the money.

273
00:19:38.535 --> 00:19:42.055
Give me half the money
and you take half the money.

274
00:19:43.055 --> 00:19:45.535
I will write stories here
and I will create the setups..

275
00:19:45.535 --> 00:19:47.654
..and I will also create
the music for our films.

276
00:19:47.654 --> 00:19:51.095
You get the girl and become the star.

277
00:19:52.095 --> 00:19:55.335
Superstar. Duper star.

278
00:19:57.335 --> 00:19:59.894
Babulal, you betrayer.
You have started your own..

279
00:19:59.894 --> 00:20:01.055
..business in front of my shop.

280
00:20:02.055 --> 00:20:05.214
This is not my business sir,
this is your business.

281
00:20:05.214 --> 00:20:07.174
Amar sir has sent all
of us out of the shop.

282
00:20:08.174 --> 00:20:09.015
Sir, I wonder what
happened to Amar sir.

283
00:20:10.015 --> 00:20:13.454
He is talking with himself
in a strange way. - With himself?

284
00:20:14.454 --> 00:20:18.535
You. I am impressed. You are great.

285
00:20:18.535 --> 00:20:22.575
I knew that there is something in you,
but so much..

286
00:20:24.575 --> 00:20:29.095
Amar salutes you. - What's going on?

287
00:20:29.095 --> 00:20:31.815
Out. I asked you to stand outside.
- You fool..

288
00:20:31.815 --> 00:20:35.974
Father, it's you. Please come.
Father, I was waiting for you.

289
00:20:35.974 --> 00:20:40.255
Father, you are wonderful.
You are great. You are an epitome.

290
00:20:40.255 --> 00:20:42.095
There is no father
like you in this world.

291
00:20:42.095 --> 00:20:44.414
You are respected.
You are worthy of worshipping.

292
00:20:44.414 --> 00:20:47.974
In fact I knew today that
you are not a man. - What?

293
00:20:47.974 --> 00:20:51.974
I mean you are a superhuman.
You are great.

294
00:20:54.974 --> 00:20:58.335
God, so you have finally
answered to my prayers.

295
00:20:58.335 --> 00:21:00.974
He has. He answered
your prayers 26 years ago.

296
00:21:00.974 --> 00:21:02.894
Where are you legs?
I want to touch your legs.

297
00:21:02.894 --> 00:21:06.095
Come on, leave it.
And tell me one thing..

298
00:21:06.095 --> 00:21:08.575
What have seen in me today?

299
00:21:09.575 --> 00:21:11.055
This is the greatness of you, father..

300
00:21:14.055 --> 00:21:18.974
You are great because
you are Amar's father.

301
00:21:18.974 --> 00:21:21.815
Today, I know you.
Tomorrow the world will know you.

302
00:21:21.815 --> 00:21:23.974
People will say,
there goes Amar's father.

303
00:21:23.974 --> 00:21:27.335
There goes Amar's father.
- The police will say this.

304
00:21:27.335 --> 00:21:31.095
There goes Amar's father.
- Father, why are you so upset?

305
00:21:31.095 --> 00:21:33.734
Whenever I become
happy you become upset.

306
00:21:33.734 --> 00:21:37.335
What else can I do!
Whenever you became happy..

307
00:21:38.335 --> 00:21:40.375
I was ruined.

308
00:21:41.375 --> 00:21:45.855
Do you remember I bought
you a cycle for the first time?

309
00:21:45.855 --> 00:21:48.295
Cycle. - You became very happy.
You drove that cycle..

310
00:21:48.295 --> 00:21:52.095
..on my father's legs.
- I remembered it.

311
00:21:52.095 --> 00:21:55.575
That's why he was called
limping father till his death.

312
00:21:56.575 --> 00:21:58.055
The second time you were very happy..

313
00:21:59.055 --> 00:22:02.015
..when I bought you
the Rambharose rocket.

314
00:22:03.015 --> 00:22:07.095
You burned the rocket
and it burned Mr. Gupta's shop.

315
00:22:08.095 --> 00:22:11.295
I am still paying him money for that.

316
00:22:13.295 --> 00:22:15.855
The third time you
were very happy when..

317
00:22:15.855 --> 00:22:20.654
..your tante 's blouse's..
-Father, past is past.

318
00:22:20.654 --> 00:22:23.894
Now, I am going to do
that for which I was born.

319
00:22:24.894 --> 00:22:27.255
What are you going to do?
- Don't worry, father.

320
00:22:28.255 --> 00:22:32.615
Picture this. Instead of 5 paisa bidi,

321
00:22:32.615 --> 00:22:34.015
there will be Rs. 50 cigar.

322
00:22:35.015 --> 00:22:36.494
And instead of this cap
there will be a costly hat.

323
00:22:37.494 --> 00:22:40.535
And instead of this dress there
will be suit and a foreign boot.

324
00:22:45.535 --> 00:22:46.974
Daddy, how is it? - It's great.

325
00:22:46.974 --> 00:22:52.414
Fine. - Thank you, daddy.
- But how will it happen?

326
00:22:52.414 --> 00:22:54.694
How? How? - Wow!

327
00:22:54.694 --> 00:22:57.855
Daddy, I am about to
marry a rich girl. - Really.

328
00:22:57.855 --> 00:23:00.694
Yes, and then we will
become very rich. - I see.

329
00:23:00.694 --> 00:23:02.654
And then I will open
many lady shops like this one.

330
00:23:02.654 --> 00:23:07.095
O really. But why don't you marry?

331
00:23:08.095 --> 00:23:11.734
Daddy, for that you have
to sell your cheap salon.

332
00:23:11.734 --> 00:23:13.055
Really. - And you have
to give me 25,000 rupees.

333
00:23:14.055 --> 00:23:15.934
25,000 rupees. - Only 25,000 rupees.

334
00:23:15.934 --> 00:23:19.894
25,000 rupees. I will not
give you even a single rupee.

335
00:23:19.894 --> 00:23:22.855
Get lost from here. Get out.

336
00:23:22.855 --> 00:23:24.934
Take this money.
Give me the 25 paisa back.

337
00:23:24.934 --> 00:23:27.295
You are not leaving even 25 paisa.

338
00:23:27.295 --> 00:23:29.654
I bought my house by saving
many 25 paisas like this.

339
00:23:29.654 --> 00:23:31.654
You are talking as if it doesn't
have any value. - Mr. Banke..

340
00:23:32.654 --> 00:23:35.694
How was your pilgrimage?
Did you see the Baba?

341
00:23:35.694 --> 00:23:40.694
It was very crowded. But
still entered and touched his feet.

342
00:23:40.694 --> 00:23:43.734
What's that rush?
Did Mr. Lala sell his house?

343
00:23:43.734 --> 00:23:45.535
Not Mr. Lala's, but you house is sold.

344
00:23:45.535 --> 00:23:48.654
My house is sold? Hold this.

345
00:23:48.654 --> 00:23:52.575
Hey, you. - Mr. Banke.

346
00:23:53.575 --> 00:23:56.255
Put that down. - Father.

347
00:23:56.255 --> 00:23:57.974
He is screaming.

348
00:23:58.974 --> 00:24:02.694
Father! - What's the matter, Nusrat?

349
00:24:02.694 --> 00:24:06.214
Who is he?
- He is Liyakat. - Liyakat who?

350
00:24:06.214 --> 00:24:09.295
In the Chimdi locality he
has a meat shop. - The meat shop!

351
00:24:09.295 --> 00:24:13.615
In place of the scissor,
the knives will be there.

352
00:24:13.615 --> 00:24:16.654
Who are you? - Who am I? - Bankelal.

353
00:24:16.654 --> 00:24:18.615
I am Bankelal.
How can you enter into my house..

354
00:24:18.615 --> 00:24:19.055
..when I went outside
for a couple of days?

355
00:24:20.055 --> 00:24:21.615
What? - All right.
You entered in my house.

356
00:24:21.615 --> 00:24:25.414
So you are brother Banke.
Greetings. - Greetings.

357
00:24:25.414 --> 00:24:27.654
When are you discharged
from the hospital? - Hospital.

358
00:24:27.654 --> 00:24:30.815
Your son said that you
are undergoing brain surgery.

359
00:24:32.815 --> 00:24:34.454
Your son is a very great son.

360
00:24:34.454 --> 00:24:37.335
He said that he wanted
money for his father's treatment.

361
00:24:37.335 --> 00:24:39.855
That's why I gave
22,000 for this house.

362
00:24:39.855 --> 00:24:41.815
You gave 22,000 and he has taken that.

363
00:24:41.815 --> 00:24:46.335
That is my ancestors' house.
I mean, it was.

364
00:24:46.335 --> 00:24:48.454
Son, I will see you.

365
00:24:51.454 --> 00:24:53.974
Babulal, great. I'm impressed.
Since the shop is full..

366
00:24:53.974 --> 00:24:57.454
..you are doing my
business outside the shop.

367
00:24:57.454 --> 00:25:00.974
No, sir. This is not your business,
sir, but this is mine.

368
00:25:00.974 --> 00:25:04.974
Your business is closed.
Your shop has been sold.

369
00:25:04.974 --> 00:25:06.894
When you went to marriage
ceremony for two days..

370
00:25:06.894 --> 00:25:08.535
Amar sir sold your shop to Mr.
Shankar.

371
00:25:08.535 --> 00:25:13.095
Your son has sold your shop to me.

372
00:25:13.095 --> 00:25:16.174
Now I will do the business
of bangles in that shop.

373
00:25:16.174 --> 00:25:18.494
And he gave this letter for you.

374
00:25:18.494 --> 00:25:19.015
This.

375
00:25:23.015 --> 00:25:28.214
The lady worth 50 crores.
Single daughter.

376
00:25:30.214 --> 00:25:32.335
I saw her when she was a kid.

377
00:25:33.335 --> 00:25:36.174
It seems that she won't
be able to live too many days.

378
00:25:38.174 --> 00:25:40.934
She is coming India to marry?

379
00:25:40.934 --> 00:25:44.015
Even the death takes one places.

380
00:25:45.015 --> 00:25:50.855
It's good. It will be fun
to play the game. Robert. - Yes, sir.

381
00:25:50.855 --> 00:25:54.375
Ask Bhalla to go to Shantivilla
and take the place..

382
00:25:54.375 --> 00:25:59.535
..of Desouza. - Ok, sir.
But sir, Bhalla has a fantastic idea.

383
00:25:59.535 --> 00:26:03.134
How about throwing Desouza
from the top of the hill.

384
00:26:03.134 --> 00:26:06.335
Robert! Keep Bhalla's
ideas to yourself.

385
00:26:13.335 --> 00:26:18.734
I know how to take each
and every step of this game.

386
00:26:19.734 --> 00:26:22.375
This game will be the
biggest game of my life.

387
00:26:24.375 --> 00:26:27.134
I will take each step
after deep contemplation.

388
00:26:29.134 --> 00:26:31.255
No one is good among them.

389
00:26:32.255 --> 00:26:34.454
Someone's nose is crooked
and other's eyes are crooked.

390
00:26:34.454 --> 00:26:36.894
Someone's ears are small
and someone's ears are large.

391
00:26:36.894 --> 00:26:38.974
Coming to India has been of no use.

392
00:26:38.974 --> 00:26:41.615
I am very angry with manager Desouza.

393
00:26:41.615 --> 00:26:44.934
How dare he to sent
this kind of photos to me!

394
00:26:44.934 --> 00:26:47.934
Anyway, where is he?
- Desouza isn't here, madam.

395
00:26:47.934 --> 00:26:49.974
Who are you? Who is he, Robert?

396
00:26:49.974 --> 00:26:53.734
Madam, he is our new manager.
- My name is Vinod.

397
00:26:53.734 --> 00:26:58.335
But the whole city knows
me as Bhalla. - Bhalla?

398
00:26:59.335 --> 00:27:03.015
But where is Desouza?
- He has left us.

399
00:27:04.015 --> 00:27:07.255
The thing is that Desouza
went on a long holiday.

400
00:27:08.255 --> 00:27:11.934
Now I am the one who will
take care of everything here.

401
00:27:15.934 --> 00:27:19.575
Robert, madam needs to
take rest and we need to work.

402
00:27:20.575 --> 00:27:22.654
Come on, follow me.

403
00:27:36.654 --> 00:27:38.654
It happened again.

404
00:27:38.654 --> 00:27:40.015
Please, you go first.
- No, you go first.

405
00:27:41.015 --> 00:27:43.815
No, I request you, please
you go first. - No, you go first.

406
00:27:43.815 --> 00:27:48.174
Brother, Mr. Nawab's missed
his train due to this 'first-you's.

407
00:27:48.174 --> 00:27:50.734
This is what Mr.
Raj Kapoor told in the film Bobby.

408
00:27:50.734 --> 00:27:53.375
And to make sure that
this bus doesn't miss..

409
00:27:53.375 --> 00:27:55.255
I will go first and then
you may come later. - Yes, please.

410
00:27:56.255 --> 00:27:57.615
Come. Come.

411
00:28:01.615 --> 00:28:04.295
What do you do? - Nothing. - I see.

412
00:28:05.295 --> 00:28:07.454
I mean I don't need to do anything.

413
00:28:08.454 --> 00:28:11.095
My father has earned a lot of money.
He has a big business.

414
00:28:12.095 --> 00:28:15.095
Which business? - Garments' business.

415
00:28:16.095 --> 00:28:17.615
We export garments.
We don't sell them here.

416
00:28:18.615 --> 00:28:20.815
All our products
go out of the country.

417
00:28:21.815 --> 00:28:25.934
You might have heard
the name 'Chaudhary & Sons'.

418
00:28:26.934 --> 00:28:31.734
Chaudhary & Sons!
Yes, I heard it. - You heard it?

419
00:28:31.734 --> 00:28:33.934
Yes, because the cloth
that comes to your company..

420
00:28:33.934 --> 00:28:35.454
..is supplied from our company.

421
00:28:36.454 --> 00:28:39.894
Mehta & Group! The textile company.
It's a big company.

422
00:28:39.894 --> 00:28:42.815
We give credits to lot of companies.
To everyone.

423
00:28:43.815 --> 00:28:46.055
Chaudhary & Sons!
I think you too owe us some money.

424
00:28:47.055 --> 00:28:49.934
I will see. I will see the accounts.

425
00:28:50.934 --> 00:28:53.575
'Mehta Textiles! When our
Chaudhary & Sons isn't there..'

426
00:28:54.575 --> 00:28:56.214
'..who can there
be Mehta Textile exist.'

427
00:28:58.214 --> 00:29:01.174
'Chaudhary & Sons!
By his face he looks..'

428
00:29:01.174 --> 00:29:03.494
'..like a third-class worker of..

429
00:29:03.494 --> 00:29:05.214
..some third-class mill. Bullshit.'

430
00:29:06.214 --> 00:29:08.454
Where did you buy this cap from?
From France?

431
00:29:08.454 --> 00:29:12.615
No, but from Switzerland.
I go there regularly.

432
00:29:16.615 --> 00:29:21.654
It suits you well. 'It looks
like a monkey is wearing a cap.'

433
00:29:23.654 --> 00:29:25.174
Where did you take
this red jacket from?

434
00:29:25.174 --> 00:29:27.134
Is this the product of
'Chaudhary & Sons'? - Non.

435
00:29:27.134 --> 00:29:28.494
Then you must have
taken this from America.

436
00:29:28.494 --> 00:29:32.855
No, I took it from New York. - I see.

437
00:29:32.855 --> 00:29:34.894
I though you bought it from America.

438
00:29:35.894 --> 00:29:39.454
'He is a liar just like me.'

439
00:29:39.454 --> 00:29:41.055
'He looks like a retired
monkey from the circus.'

440
00:29:43.055 --> 00:29:45.815
By the way are you going? - Ooty.

441
00:29:45.815 --> 00:29:48.615
I am also going Ooty.
- You are also going Ooty?

442
00:29:48.615 --> 00:29:50.295
It seems that three of
us have the same destination.

443
00:29:50.295 --> 00:29:51.295
It will be fun-full ride. - Yes.

444
00:30:28.295 --> 00:30:30.055
''Two passionate persons
are going to start their life.''

445
00:30:31.055 --> 00:30:33.894
''They are cunning,
but they are called crazy.''

446
00:30:33.894 --> 00:30:36.934
''Two passionate persons
are going to start their life.''

447
00:30:36.934 --> 00:30:39.734
''They are cunning,
but they are called crazy.''

448
00:30:39.734 --> 00:30:42.654
''In search of some unknown beauty..''

449
00:30:42.654 --> 00:30:45.454
''In search of some unknown beauty..''

450
00:30:45.454 --> 00:30:47.934
''..to flirt with her
without losing the heart.''

451
00:30:47.934 --> 00:30:50.734
''..to flirt with her.''

452
00:30:56.734 --> 00:30:59.615
''Two passionate persons
are going to start their life.''

453
00:30:59.615 --> 00:31:02.414
''They are cunning,
but they are called crazy.''

454
00:31:02.414 --> 00:31:05.375
''Two passionate persons
are going to start their life.''

455
00:31:08.375 --> 00:31:11.454
''In search of some unknown beauty..''

456
00:31:11.454 --> 00:31:14.255
''In search of some unknown beauty..''

457
00:31:14.255 --> 00:31:16.894
''..to flirt with her
without losing the heart.''

458
00:31:16.894 --> 00:31:18.535
''..To cunning persons.''

459
00:31:54.535 --> 00:31:57.454
''Buddy, there will be someone..''

460
00:31:57.454 --> 00:32:00.335
''..who will treat me like her own.''

461
00:32:00.335 --> 00:32:03.894
''Dear. Dear. Dear.''

462
00:32:05.894 --> 00:32:08.015
