01:00:52.375 --> 01:00:56.255
Raveena. - But you
need to get well very soon.

920
01:00:56.255 --> 01:01:00.175
Why? Why soon? - Because Mr.
Bajaj is coming tomorrow.

921
01:01:00.175 --> 01:01:03.295
Sir, I made a mistake by fault.
I forgot to tell you..

922
01:01:03.295 --> 01:01:07.335
..that Mr.
Bajaj made a call from London.

923
01:01:07.335 --> 01:01:09.335
He isn't coming tomorrow,
but he is coming next week.

924
01:01:09.335 --> 01:01:10.534
Sometimes daddy does
such strange things.

925
01:01:10.534 --> 01:01:12.454
He left us alone in a foreign land.

926
01:01:12.454 --> 01:01:14.735
He isn't bothered about us at all.
- Yes, I was also thinking..

927
01:01:14.735 --> 01:01:18.295
..the same.
He isn't bothered about you.

928
01:01:18.295 --> 01:01:21.735
What kind of a father he is!
He should've been here with you.

929
01:01:21.735 --> 01:01:25.655
Think, how can two single
girls stay alone is a new city!

930
01:01:25.655 --> 01:01:27.655
Robert, call him. I will talk to him.

931
01:01:30.655 --> 01:01:33.014
Who am I? Where am I?

932
01:01:36.014 --> 01:01:37.534
Very smart.

933
01:01:42.534 --> 01:01:46.054
Who is this? - Very smart.

934
01:01:47.054 --> 01:01:49.414
It seems that you belonged
to a royal family.

935
01:01:54.414 --> 01:01:58.094
He is my twin brother.
Ram Gopal Bajaj.

936
01:01:59.094 --> 01:02:02.534
And my name isn't Teja.
I am Shyam Gopal Bajaj.

937
01:02:02.534 --> 01:02:06.255
Shyam-Ram.
Ram-Shyam. - How very interesting!

938
01:02:09.255 --> 01:02:12.375
My father used to love him a lot.

939
01:02:12.375 --> 01:02:15.175
I don't know what he magic
he learned but everyone..

940
01:02:15.175 --> 01:02:18.974
..used to treat him as
Ram and me as Ravan( demon ).

941
01:02:18.974 --> 01:02:23.695
Right then I thought that
I will kill him as well as him.

942
01:02:24.695 --> 01:02:28.695
I tried a lot. But by mistake
I killed my accountant..

943
01:02:28.695 --> 01:02:33.454
..Mani Shankar.
But it was profitable in a way.

944
01:02:33.454 --> 01:02:36.695
He used to talk a lot about charity.

945
01:02:37.695 --> 01:02:42.255
And because of that
case I got 10 years' term.

946
01:02:42.255 --> 01:02:44.534
I was in the jail for 10 years.

947
01:02:44.534 --> 01:02:46.934
And when I was released
everything was changed.

948
01:02:46.934 --> 01:02:50.855
My brother left to London
and turned 1 crore into 30 crores.

949
01:02:50.855 --> 01:02:54.215
But sir, why didn't you go to London?

950
01:02:54.215 --> 01:02:55.934
How could I have gone to London!

951
01:02:56.934 --> 01:02:57.255
The police was following me.

952
01:02:59.255 --> 01:03:01.534
I cheated Mogambo
and took his 5 lakhs.

953
01:03:01.534 --> 01:03:05.855
Now his nephew is searching me.
I too want to see London.

954
01:03:05.855 --> 01:03:07.135
But how could I go to London!

955
01:03:07.135 --> 01:03:08.335
How sad!

956
01:03:09.335 --> 01:03:14.534
But now our bad days are gone.
She is his daughter.

957
01:03:15.534 --> 01:03:18.255
The moment I get hold of her..

958
01:03:20.255 --> 01:03:22.494
Then I am not going
to be defeated like Ravan.

959
01:03:22.494 --> 01:03:26.695
I won't be defeated.
I will take all the right steps.

960
01:03:27.695 --> 01:03:30.014
Just one murder for the
profit of crores of rupees?

961
01:03:31.014 --> 01:03:34.614
Mr. Teja, leave this to me.

962
01:03:34.614 --> 01:03:39.335
I will kill him in such a
way he himself will know about it.

963
01:03:39.335 --> 01:03:43.574
But you will kill him,
when he comes to India.

964
01:03:43.574 --> 01:03:46.574
But when will he come to India?

965
01:03:46.574 --> 01:03:50.894
Sir, his daughter is here,
so he will definitely come to India.

966
01:03:50.894 --> 01:03:54.054
Very good. Very good.

967
01:03:57.054 --> 01:03:58.974
Kill her daughter.

968
01:04:02.974 --> 01:04:05.855
Who? Who's this? Miss. Raveena?

969
01:04:05.855 --> 01:04:08.695
What happened, Tilu? - Miss. Raveena..

970
01:04:08.695 --> 01:04:12.454
..when I woke up, I saw that
the light of my eyes was gone.

971
01:04:13.454 --> 01:04:15.574
Where are we?

972
01:04:17.574 --> 01:04:20.295
When I lost my memory,
the world became a stranger.

973
01:04:21.295 --> 01:04:24.335
Now when the light
of my eyes is diminishing..

974
01:04:24.335 --> 01:04:26.934
..the world is becoming dark.
- Control yourself, Tilu.

975
01:04:26.934 --> 01:04:30.695
How can I! Just a moment. Come here.

976
01:04:35.695 --> 01:04:38.855
Please leave me.
Please leave me. - Non.

977
01:04:38.855 --> 01:04:41.414
What are you doing!
- I don't want to live anymore.

978
01:04:41.414 --> 01:04:46.454
What's going on?
- Tilu is committing suicide.

979
01:04:46.454 --> 01:04:49.534
I see. Madam,
there is someone for you.

980
01:04:49.534 --> 01:04:52.494
- Leave me. - Meet me? - Oh God.

981
01:04:55.494 --> 01:04:59.614
Who are you?
- What do you want? - Police.

982
01:04:59.614 --> 01:05:02.335
Don't worry. I am police-doctor.

983
01:05:02.335 --> 01:05:05.815
The way police finds the thief..

984
01:05:06.815 --> 01:05:09.974
..similarly I find the patient.

985
01:05:09.974 --> 01:05:12.135
Doctor Prem Khurana.

986
01:05:14.135 --> 01:05:15.414
Purana?

987
01:05:25.414 --> 01:05:28.934
I got the information that
there is a patient in your house.

988
01:05:28.934 --> 01:05:31.494
Actually,
I haven't done that knowingly.

989
01:05:31.494 --> 01:05:34.175
I was standing and he..
- I know but where is he?

990
01:05:35.175 --> 01:05:37.414
I didn't know that
he will lose his memory.

991
01:05:37.414 --> 01:05:40.695
And now even Tilu's eye
sight is in trouble. - Tilu.

992
01:05:40.695 --> 01:05:44.014
Yes, since we found him
on the Tila(hill), we gave him..

993
01:05:48.014 --> 01:05:50.414
You? - Have you seen it!
His memory is coming back.

994
01:05:50.414 --> 01:05:54.414
That means you can bring
his memory back? - Definitely.

995
01:05:54.414 --> 01:05:56.335
I am very well-versed
with such type of patients.

996
01:05:56.335 --> 01:05:59.295
Miss. Raveena, who is he?
- He is a doctor.

997
01:05:59.295 --> 01:06:02.295
Dr. Prem Khurana.
I am very experienced in all these.

998
01:06:03.295 --> 01:06:06.335
Is he a doctor or a carpenter?
- My father was a carpenter.

999
01:06:06.335 --> 01:06:08.135
I don't want to be treated by him.

1000
01:06:08.135 --> 01:06:10.375
Give me poison,
but don't hand me over to him.

1001
01:06:10.375 --> 01:06:13.695
I want to die. - I will
take care of that. Leave her hand.

1002
01:06:13.695 --> 01:06:14.014
Non. - Leave her hand. - Non.

1003
01:06:15.014 --> 01:06:16.894
Miss. Raveena,
this disease spreads by touching.

1004
01:06:19.894 --> 01:06:22.094
Miss. Raveena, now I'm here.
Everything will be alright.

1005
01:06:23.094 --> 01:06:26.295
My name is Prem. Prem Khurana.

1006
01:06:26.295 --> 01:06:28.894
Now see, how I treat him.

1007
01:06:47.894 --> 01:06:50.855
Prem, did you forget our friendship?
I am your friend.

1008
01:06:50.855 --> 01:06:52.534
I don't care about your friendship.

1009
01:06:52.534 --> 01:06:54.934
I feel like killing you.
- I brought the horse's injection.

1010
01:06:54.934 --> 01:06:56.574
You will shout like a horse.

1011
01:07:01.574 --> 01:07:05.175
..personal talk.
- Is it so personal? - It's personal.

1012
01:07:13.175 --> 01:07:16.295
What's happening!
Doctor. Tilu. Treatment.

1013
01:07:16.295 --> 01:07:18.655
What's going on? - Miss. Raveena.

1014
01:07:18.655 --> 01:07:19.094
You are the only one
who can understand my pain.

1015
01:07:20.094 --> 01:07:21.414
I don't want memory.
I will manage it..

1016
01:07:21.414 --> 01:07:23.135
..with the little memory left in me.

1017
01:07:23.135 --> 01:07:25.255
Miss. Raveena,
this disease spreads with contact.

1018
01:07:26.255 --> 01:07:27.614
When the treatment in done..

1019
01:07:27.614 --> 01:07:30.494
..the people and even the
food should be kept away from him.

1020
01:07:30.494 --> 01:07:31.855
I heard that if he gets
hit at the same place again..

1021
01:07:31.855 --> 01:07:34.494
..then there is a chance
that his memory may be back.

1022
01:07:34.494 --> 01:07:38.815
Yes. That's true.
- Shall we hit him one more time?

1023
01:07:38.815 --> 01:07:42.135
Why not! Not a bad idea.

1024
01:07:42.135 --> 01:07:46.614
But you should hit at the
same nerve and that too very hard.

1025
01:07:46.614 --> 01:07:48.494
I will try. I may hit it right ..

1026
01:07:48.494 --> 01:07:50.934
.. if I hit him a couple of times,
doctor. - Oh God, I am dead.

1027
01:07:50.934 --> 01:07:55.815
O Non. - No, Miss.
Raveena. You hit him then..

1028
01:07:55.815 --> 01:07:58.695
Now I will hit him.
- What do you mean! I brought him.

1029
01:07:58.695 --> 01:08:01.014
You are going to be beaten very badly.

1030
01:08:02.014 --> 01:08:06.335
I brought him here, so I'll hit him.
- No, give me a chance.

1031
01:08:07.335 --> 01:08:09.494
Madam, you leave this job to me.

1032
01:08:09.494 --> 01:08:12.454
You just tell me that when
and how many times I shout hit..

1033
01:08:12.454 --> 01:08:15.534
..the patient.
- Sir, shall I hit? - Shut up.

1034
01:08:15.534 --> 01:08:18.494
Two there and two here, four.

1035
01:08:18.494 --> 01:08:24.614
Sir, may I? - What is this Robert?
- Doctor is here. - Please Raveena.

1036
01:08:24.614 --> 01:08:27.895
Silent. Silent. Quiet. Order.

1037
01:08:27.895 --> 01:08:29.095
Everyone will get a chance.

1038
01:08:30.095 --> 01:08:32.734
When the patient wakes up,
you will hit him two times.

1039
01:08:32.734 --> 01:08:34.335
And whenever the
patient wants to sleep..

1040
01:08:34.335 --> 01:08:36.215
..give hit him two times. - O Non.

1041
01:08:36.215 --> 01:08:38.614
But sir, I wake up before everyone.
- Shut up. - No, shut up.

1042
01:08:38.614 --> 01:08:42.015
Doctor, I will hit him first.
- Raveena. Raveena.

1043
01:08:43.015 --> 01:08:50.215
He is running. - Leave me.

1044
01:08:50.215 --> 01:08:51.854
Help. Help.

1045
01:08:51.854 --> 01:08:55.734
Somebody help me. - One, two, three.

1046
01:08:59.734 --> 01:09:01.734
Doctor, is there any serious problem?

1047
01:09:01.734 --> 01:09:03.414
I gave given the injections but..

1048
01:09:03.414 --> 01:09:05.534
..hitting him is very necessary
along with God's grace.

1049
01:09:05.534 --> 01:09:06.614
Don't forget to hit him.

1050
01:09:06.614 --> 01:09:09.295
And till he gets treated
I will stay in this house.

1051
01:09:09.295 --> 01:09:12.895
Very smart. How can you stay here?
- I am just like that.

1052
01:09:12.895 --> 01:09:14.854
Robert, arrange a room
for him in the outhouse.

1053
01:09:14.854 --> 01:09:17.055
Not in the outhouse.
Is there any room nearby your room?

1054
01:09:18.055 --> 01:09:20.175
Ok, then, give him the
room that is in front of my room.

1055
01:09:20.175 --> 01:09:23.095
Is there one beside yours?
- There is one on my side.

1056
01:09:23.095 --> 01:09:24.414
Non. The front room will work for me.
Ok, thank you.

1057
01:09:31.414 --> 01:09:34.694
Did you fell sick after
looking at the doctor? - Non.

1058
01:09:34.694 --> 01:09:38.854
Come. Let's hit Tilu.
- Yes, let's do that.

1059
01:09:38.854 --> 01:09:42.895
This bouquet is very special.
- It's very beautiful, sir.

1060
01:09:42.895 --> 01:09:45.135
I have fit the time bomb in it.
- You keep it.

1061
01:09:46.135 --> 01:09:53.015
The moment she will pick this bouquet,
this bomb will blast.

1062
01:09:54.015 --> 01:09:56.454
And that time will be
the last moment of her life.

1063
01:09:57.454 --> 01:10:00.095
Now it's the time for
you to keep the bouquet.

1064
01:10:00.095 --> 01:10:02.494
But boss, if I keep the bouquet
there the police will arrest me.

1065
01:10:02.494 --> 01:10:06.694
Don't worry, Robert.
I have written Tilu's name in that.

1066
01:10:07.694 --> 01:10:11.135
Tilu will go to the prison
and the Raveena will go to heaven.

1067
01:10:11.135 --> 01:10:14.015
Wow. That means two arrows,
one target.

1068
01:10:15.015 --> 01:10:20.494
Shut up, Robert. This is called
one target with one arrow. Go.

1069
01:10:20.494 --> 01:10:24.295
The time is less.
- Have you switched it on?

1070
01:10:24.295 --> 01:10:26.335
Yes. - O God.
Not from this way, from this way.

1071
01:10:31.335 --> 01:10:36.015
Robert, is the car ready?
- No, I mean yes. Non.

1072
01:10:40.015 --> 01:10:43.854
Sir, I have kept the time-bomb
on the table at correct time.

1073
01:10:43.854 --> 01:10:45.295
Miss. Raveena is coming outside.

1074
01:10:45.295 --> 01:10:48.414
Very good timing, Robert.
- Sir, the timing may be good.

1075
01:10:48.414 --> 01:10:53.414
But when will our good times come.
- It will come soon.

1076
01:10:54.414 --> 01:10:59.175
What's this?
Flowers. For Miss. Raveena? Tilu.

1077
01:11:00.175 --> 01:11:02.614
I have to do something about you.

1078
01:11:02.614 --> 01:11:05.734
But let me change the name first.
Who's that?

1079
01:11:06.734 --> 01:11:09.335
Whom are you giving the bouquet to?
And what's there?

1080
01:11:10.335 --> 01:11:14.734
What are you hiding?
To Miss. Raveena? And what's this?

1081
01:11:14.734 --> 01:11:16.095
You cut my name and written your name.
What's this!

1082
01:11:17.095 --> 01:11:19.574
Amar, don't come in-between us.
You Tilu.

1083
01:11:19.574 --> 01:11:21.414
Whom are you calling Tilu!
I will punch you.

1084
01:11:21.414 --> 01:11:23.534
What's going on? What happened, Tilu?

1085
01:11:23.534 --> 01:11:26.095
See this, Miss. Raveena.
You Tilu brought flowers for you..

1086
01:11:26.095 --> 01:11:28.975
..and this doctor is
beating me for this. - O Non.

1087
01:11:28.975 --> 01:11:31.414
Why doctor? - No, Miss.
Raveena. I brought the flowers.

1088
01:11:31.414 --> 01:11:34.135
I brought them.
I brought it. - No, I brought it.

1089
01:11:35.135 --> 01:11:37.215
Miss. Raveena,
I am coming from that side.

1090
01:11:37.215 --> 01:11:44.414
Ms. Raveena. - Hey, wait.

1091
01:11:44.414 --> 01:11:50.614
Hey, give it to me. - Miss.
Raveena, I am coming from that side.

1092
01:11:50.614 --> 01:11:52.015
I brought them.
I brought it. - No, I brought it.

1093
01:11:53.015 --> 01:11:55.654
Miss. Raveena, catch it. - O No.

1094
01:12:00.654 --> 01:12:03.814
Yes. - 10. - 9. - 8.

1095
01:12:03.814 --> 01:12:05.814
You threw it. - You threw it.

1096
01:12:05.814 --> 01:12:09.494
5. - 4. - 3. - 2.

1097
01:12:09.494 --> 01:12:14.135
The blast. - O God. What was that?

1098
01:12:23.135 --> 01:12:26.335
So you want to say that
because of those two fools..

1099
01:12:33.335 --> 01:12:36.654
My heart has full of joy.
- Sorry, sir.

1100
01:12:40.654 --> 01:12:43.375
..boys are very clever.
Yesterday on the table..

1101
01:12:43.375 --> 01:12:49.175
Shut up, Robert.
Mr. Teja, you don't worry at all.

1102
01:12:50.175 --> 01:12:54.215
The rats can't disturb
the lion at any cost.

1103
01:12:55.215 --> 01:12:59.055
According to our new plan. - The plan!

1104
01:13:01.055 --> 01:13:08.534
You ruined my plan.
You talk too much but do nothing.

1105
01:13:08.534 --> 01:13:10.975
I don't want to hear
any excuses this time.

1106
01:13:10.975 --> 01:13:13.494
Do anything, but finish the game.

1107
01:13:13.494 --> 01:13:15.574
And this time come along
with the news of death.

1108
01:13:16.574 --> 01:13:19.295
If you wish, I will come
here along with the dead body.

1109
01:13:19.295 --> 01:13:24.854
Or I'll bring them here and
kill in front of you. - Very smart.

1110
01:13:24.854 --> 01:13:28.895
Sir, we have found one
more thing very smartly.

1111
01:13:28.895 --> 01:13:33.734
Mr. Bajaj has converted all
his wealth of London in diamonds.

1112
01:13:33.734 --> 01:13:36.414
And he will come here within ten days.
We heard it while..

1113
01:13:36.414 --> 01:13:38.734
..he was talking with
her daughter on the phone.

1114
01:13:41.734 --> 01:13:44.135
What did the boss say?
- I couldn't hear anything..

1115
01:13:45.135 --> 01:13:47.215
..but I am sure that
he might have said smart boy.

1116
01:13:51.215 --> 01:13:54.694
Miss. Raveena, will I get
food to eat today? - Yes, Tilu.

1117
01:13:54.694 --> 01:13:57.895
Really. - Yes, definitely.

1118
01:13:57.895 --> 01:14:01.055
Has the doctor left?
- Leave about doctor. Come and eat.

1119
01:14:04.055 --> 01:14:05.175
So much food? Just for me?

1120
01:14:06.175 --> 01:14:09.375
Chicken.
Biriyani. Kabab.. - Be careful.

1121
01:14:09.375 --> 01:14:11.975
What shall I eat!
Let me eat Chicken first.

1122
01:14:11.975 --> 01:14:16.414
O Non. Who hit me?
- Do not touch. Don't touch it.

1123
01:14:17.414 --> 01:14:21.055
That food is for me.
And this food is for you.

1124
01:14:22.055 --> 01:14:26.055
Karishma, item Non.
1. The black pepper balls.

1125
01:14:34.055 --> 01:14:38.654
Miss. Raveena,
I feel like my memory is coming back.

1126
01:14:39.654 --> 01:14:41.895
Do you remember your grandma? - Non.

1127
01:14:41.895 --> 01:14:44.055
Then eat. - Tilu! Please eat.

1128
01:14:45.055 --> 01:14:46.015
If you won't eat,
then how will you be treated?

1129
01:14:47.015 --> 01:14:51.335
Take it as medicine.
Doctor has specially made it for you.

1130
01:14:51.335 --> 01:14:54.375
Doctor. I will never eat this. ..

1131
01:14:54.375 --> 01:14:55.814
.. I will die,
but I will never eat it.

1132
01:14:55.814 --> 01:14:59.614
How can you die so easily, Tilu?

1133
01:14:59.614 --> 01:15:03.975
I will not let you die so easily.

1134
01:15:03.975 --> 01:15:07.454
Raveena, you feed him
with your hands. - Non.

1135
01:15:07.454 --> 01:15:13.335
Now you have to eat, Tilu.
Or else Raveena will feel hurt.

1136
01:15:13.335 --> 01:15:14.295
Eat it.

1137
01:15:20.295 --> 01:15:21.694
No.

1138
01:15:36.694 --> 01:15:43.814
Doctor. You are very clever.
- Really? - Really.

1139
01:15:53.814 --> 01:15:56.814
Whom are you serving the food for?
- For the doctor.

1140
01:15:57.814 --> 01:16:00.414
Is this food special? - Yes, sir.

1141
01:16:00.414 --> 01:16:04.255
