2074
02:18:54.102 --> 02:18:57.061
Wait. I'm good at
throwing the shot put.

2075
02:19:01.061 --> 02:19:03.541
Got him.
- What aim the rabbit has got.

2076
02:19:03.541 --> 02:19:05.541
Not rabbit but Robert.
- That's it. - Come fast.

2077
02:19:05.541 --> 02:19:08.781
Smart boy. - We got the diamonds.

2078
02:19:11.781 --> 02:19:14.502
You wait here and Teja will
come and give you the reward.

2079
02:19:14.502 --> 02:19:16.621
Yes. - Till Teja regains
consciousness.. - Teja?

2080
02:19:16.621 --> 02:19:18.301
Till then you keep
throwing stones on uncle.

2081
02:19:18.301 --> 02:19:19.221
Correct your tie
and straighten your cap.

2082
02:19:22.221 --> 02:19:25.662
Did he say phone Teja and
hit him or hit Teja and phone him.

2083
02:19:25.662 --> 02:19:27.742
Him.

2084
02:19:27.742 --> 02:19:30.781
Daddy! - Dear! - Uncle.

2085
02:19:34.781 --> 02:19:36.781
My name is crime master Gogo.

2086
02:19:36.781 --> 02:19:38.621
I'll take out your eyes
and play marbles with it.

2087
02:19:38.621 --> 02:19:41.621
I'll not leave anybody, not even Teja.

2088
02:19:41.621 --> 02:19:43.381
This is not Teja. It's my daddy.

2089
02:19:43.381 --> 02:19:45.342
Teja has gone to the bank.

2090
02:19:46.342 --> 02:19:48.061
What drama is this?
Take all three of them.

2091
02:19:52.061 --> 02:19:55.262
They told us that they
will come and didn't come.

2092
02:19:56.262 --> 02:19:59.141
Crime master Gogo.
Where is your boss Teja?

2093
02:19:59.141 --> 02:20:00.342
Where are my diamonds?

2094
02:20:00.342 --> 02:20:02.102
Teja has gone to bring the girls.

2095
02:20:02.102 --> 02:20:03.662
Amar has gone to give
the diamonds to Teja.

2096
02:20:03.662 --> 02:20:04.902
Bajaj is lying there.
- Bajaj is with me in the ..

2097
02:20:04.902 --> 02:20:07.981
..car along with the girls.
- But Bajaj is lying there.

2098
02:20:07.981 --> 02:20:09.182
This is not Bajaj
but the one in the car..

2099
02:20:09.182 --> 02:20:10.301
..is Bajaj. - No, he is here.

2100
02:20:15.301 --> 02:20:18.781
Shouting unnecessarily.
- Stupid fellow.

2101
02:20:18.781 --> 02:20:20.981
Correct.

2102
02:20:21.981 --> 02:20:25.902
Where are you going alone?
- I was looking for you.

2103
02:20:25.902 --> 02:20:29.621
Why? - That fellow has taken
both the girls and uncle. - Who?

2104
02:20:29.621 --> 02:20:31.342
Crime master Gogo.

2105
02:20:31.342 --> 02:20:34.342
He has said that if you
want to see them alive then come..

2106
02:20:34.342 --> 02:20:36.141
..with the diamonds to this address.
- Show me.

2107
02:20:37.141 --> 02:20:40.022
He has also said that if
you inform the police then.. - Then?

2108
02:20:41.022 --> 02:20:43.941
Then do it, nothing to worry.
- Oh god!

2109
02:20:43.941 --> 02:20:45.182
He seems to be a seasoned player.

2110
02:20:46.182 --> 02:20:48.262
Get down fast. Careful.

2111
02:20:49.262 --> 02:20:50.182
Come.

2112
02:20:52.182 --> 02:20:56.941
Crime master Gogo. I'll take
out your eyes and play marbles.

2113
02:20:56.941 --> 02:21:01.502
Hands up. - Put up your hands.
- They were up only.

2114
02:21:01.502 --> 02:21:01.022
Come, follow me.

2115
02:21:04.022 --> 02:21:05.822
Look they have come.

2116
02:21:05.822 --> 02:21:08.981
Why are they following
him with their hands up?

2117
02:21:11.981 --> 02:21:13.621
The jokers.

2118
02:21:14.621 --> 02:21:14.461
Careful.

2119
02:21:16.461 --> 02:21:19.182
Be careful. - Mr. Gogo, your gown.

2120
02:21:19.182 --> 02:21:24.342
I will gather it.
Follow me. - Greetings.

2121
02:21:24.342 --> 02:21:26.461
How are you?

2122
02:21:26.461 --> 02:21:28.582
Hi girls. - Hi.

2123
02:21:28.582 --> 02:21:30.102
What are these greetings?

2124
02:21:30.102 --> 02:21:31.381
Have you come for a party?

2125
02:21:31.381 --> 02:21:33.662
Gogo the diamonds are with them.

2126
02:21:34.662 --> 02:21:37.262
Uncle. Greetings uncle.

2127
02:21:40.262 --> 02:21:43.941
But there is a mark on Teja'a cheeks,
isn't it Robert?

2128
02:21:43.941 --> 02:21:46.301
Yes, the mark should be there.

2129
02:21:46.301 --> 02:21:48.422
What mark?

2130
02:21:48.422 --> 02:21:50.781
I'm Teja and my name is also Teja.

2131
02:21:50.781 --> 02:21:53.902
I'm Teja, you white Ramu. I'm Teja.

2132
02:21:53.902 --> 02:21:55.902
Ramu behave yourself, I'm Teja.

2133
02:21:55.902 --> 02:22:00.221
I'm Teja.
- I'm Teja since the mark is here.

2134
02:22:00.221 --> 02:22:02.182
Hell with the mark, I'm Teja.

2135
02:22:02.182 --> 02:22:05.342
I'm Teja since the mark is here.
- Silence.

2136
02:22:05.342 --> 02:22:06.221
I'm Teja.

2137
02:22:07.221 --> 02:22:10.141
What is all this?

2138
02:22:11.141 --> 02:22:14.981
I want to know where are the diamonds?

2139
02:22:14.981 --> 02:22:17.981
Mr. Gogo how can we have the diamonds?

2140
02:22:17.981 --> 02:22:20.861
We are like innocent birds.

2141
02:22:20.861 --> 02:22:22.342
We are the birds on the same branch.

2142
02:22:22.342 --> 02:22:25.342
The birds flying in the sky.
Isn't it Prem? - Why not?

2143
02:22:25.342 --> 02:22:29.781
We are kids. - Tender brains.
- Good at heart. Isn't it Prem?

2144
02:22:29.781 --> 02:22:32.742
Why not?
- We just came to free the girls.

2145
02:22:32.742 --> 02:22:35.822
Let's free the girls, what do you say?
- Why not?

2146
02:22:35.822 --> 02:22:37.422
Let's untie them.

2147
02:22:39.422 --> 02:22:42.381
Don't act smart.
I will remove your eyes..

2148
02:22:42.381 --> 02:22:43.182
..and play marble with them.

2149
02:22:44.182 --> 02:22:45.061
But why do you want to
play marbles with our eyes.

2150
02:22:46.061 --> 02:22:47.662
You can play marbles with their eyes.

2151
02:22:47.662 --> 02:22:49.662
See how big they are.

2152
02:22:54.662 --> 02:22:57.022
My men, this Robert gave it to them.

2153
02:23:01.022 --> 02:23:03.861
Look at this funny story.
How can his men snatch it from..

2154
02:23:03.861 --> 02:23:06.221
..him and give it to us?
Robert and Bhalla..

2155
02:23:08.221 --> 02:23:12.621
No, how can I do that? - No, never.

2156
02:23:13.621 --> 02:23:16.541
Mr. Gogo, they are going by your face.

2157
02:23:17.541 --> 02:23:18.141
What's wrong with my face?

2158
02:23:19.141 --> 02:23:20.662
They think that you're an idiot.

2159
02:23:20.662 --> 02:23:25.342
Prem, he looks like a fool,
an idiot and an ass from the face..

2160
02:23:25.342 --> 02:23:29.381
..but he is not one.
- Are you praising me or abusing me?

2161
02:23:29.381 --> 02:23:32.422
Abuse. - Praise, sir, praise.

2162
02:23:33.422 --> 02:23:36.022
I have been hearing
about you from my childhood.

2163
02:23:37.022 --> 02:23:39.902
Prem. Do you know when I used
to cry what my mother used to say?

2164
02:23:43.902 --> 02:23:49.342
She used to say sleep
son or else Gogo will come.

2165
02:23:52.342 --> 02:23:56.381
Did you hear the fame
of crime master Gogo?

2166
02:23:56.381 --> 02:24:00.342
When a child doesn't
sleep the mother tells it ..

2167
02:24:00.342 --> 02:24:02.061
..sleep or else Gogo will come.

2168
02:24:04.061 --> 02:24:05.861
Tell me more. - And.

2169
02:24:05.861 --> 02:24:08.662
I have also heard that you're
a philanthropist, an enlightened..

2170
02:24:08.662 --> 02:24:12.621
..one, a revered saint
and the man with inner knowledge.

2171
02:24:12.621 --> 02:24:13.822
You are a powerful man,
an intelligent man.

2172
02:24:14.822 --> 02:24:17.822
I will also say that you're not a man.

2173
02:24:17.822 --> 02:24:19.262
Superman.

2174
02:24:20.262 --> 02:24:21.822
I think that we should
leave with the girls now.

2175
02:24:22.822 --> 02:24:24.981
You will surely get the
diamonds from these people.

2176
02:24:24.981 --> 02:24:26.902
Prem, arrange for a taxi.

2177
02:24:28.902 --> 02:24:32.621
I'm an intelligent
man and a learned soul.

2178
02:24:32.621 --> 02:24:34.342
Please help us.

2179
02:24:38.342 --> 02:24:40.822
Not only that I'm not even a man.

2180
02:24:43.822 --> 02:24:46.662
Shall I tell you what
my mother told me? - What?

2181
02:24:46.662 --> 02:24:52.461
She told me,
son Gogo, first take and then give.

2182
02:24:52.461 --> 02:24:55.422
First I'll take the diamonds
and then give the girls.

2183
02:24:55.422 --> 02:24:58.621
Why are you after us?
We're innocent birds.

2184
02:24:58.621 --> 02:25:00.902
We just want to fly.

2185
02:25:00.902 --> 02:25:01.102
We all belong to same branch.

2186
02:25:02.102 --> 02:25:03.902
Come on, hands up.

2187
02:25:04.902 --> 02:25:07.422
I have a rifle.
- It's not a rifle but a revolver..

2188
02:25:07.422 --> 02:25:08.141
..Move it that side.

2189
02:25:09.141 --> 02:25:10.061
Gogo hands up.

2190
02:25:11.061 --> 02:25:12.022
Hands up.

2191
02:25:14.022 --> 02:25:18.061
That's great. Well done my tiger.

2192
02:25:19.061 --> 02:25:21.662
Now the tiger is out of the den.

2193
02:25:21.662 --> 02:25:25.781
Don't move or else
I'll shake you all up.

2194
02:25:25.781 --> 02:25:28.861
All of you put down your guns.

2195
02:25:29.861 --> 02:25:31.941
Not you. You'll have us dead.

2196
02:25:33.941 --> 02:25:38.742
I'm that type who will
eat you up and not even burp.

2197
02:25:41.742 --> 02:25:44.662
You call yourself crime master Gogo?

2198
02:26:01.662 --> 02:26:03.141
Robert!

2199
02:26:07.141 --> 02:26:09.582
It was a mistake.

2200
02:26:19.582 --> 02:26:21.141
Oh god!

2201
02:26:25.141 --> 02:26:28.102
Amar. - Shut up Prem,
my anger is dangerous.

2202
02:26:28.102 --> 02:26:29.102
I can do anything.

2203
02:26:30.102 --> 02:26:34.461
Bullets. - Yes,
I will shoot them all with bullets.

2204
02:26:34.461 --> 02:26:35.061
There are no bullets.

2205
02:26:37.061 --> 02:26:38.822
Dead!

2206
02:26:41.822 --> 02:26:42.102
Oh god! Why?

2207
02:26:48.102 --> 02:26:53.381
Mr. Teja, don't take it to your heart.

2208
02:26:54.381 --> 02:27:00.742
Mr. Gogo.
Crime master Gogo. I was just joking.

2209
02:27:00.742 --> 02:27:03.781
I have been hearing
your stories from childhood.

2210
02:27:03.781 --> 02:27:05.902
'Listen, the people of the world.'

2211
02:27:05.902 --> 02:27:07.141
'The most famous amongst
all is Mr. Gogo.'

2212
02:27:10.141 --> 02:27:12.502
I'm a child with a tender heart.

2213
02:27:13.502 --> 02:27:15.182
Brothers pick up your guns.

2214
02:27:16.182 --> 02:27:19.781
We are innocent birds,
the ones flying in the sky.

2215
02:27:19.781 --> 02:27:21.342
Amar, what should I do with this?

2216
02:27:24.342 --> 02:27:27.822
There is no bullet in this?
- I told you. - Then throw it away.

2217
02:27:29.822 --> 02:27:33.022
Enough of this drama.
Now I will kill everyone.

2218
02:27:36.022 --> 02:27:40.022
Tell me what is your
last wish before dying?

2219
02:27:41.022 --> 02:27:43.022
Give me that loaded pistol.

2220
02:27:48.022 --> 02:27:50.342
What is you last wish?

2221
02:27:52.342 --> 02:27:55.022
I want to bash him
up before I die. - Non.

2222
02:27:57.022 --> 02:28:00.662
Please, Gogo,
let be bash him up. - Non.

2223
02:28:00.662 --> 02:28:04.301
Two minutes time is given.
You bash him up if you can.

2224
02:28:04.301 --> 02:28:06.582
You save yourself if you can. - Non.

2225
02:28:06.582 --> 02:28:08.061
Action. - Oh god!

2226
02:28:09.061 --> 02:28:10.861
Oh god!

2227
02:28:13.861 --> 02:28:15.381
Oh god! - Oh god!

2228
02:28:22.381 --> 02:28:24.102
If there was non bullets
then why did you tell that.

2229
02:28:26.102 --> 02:28:28.342
Mistake. - Don't kick me.

2230
02:28:28.342 --> 02:28:30.502
You fool! - Don't kick me.

2231
02:28:35.502 --> 02:28:39.822
Oh god! Cheating! Not the chair.

2232
02:28:41.822 --> 02:28:42.582
Amar!

2233
02:28:46.582 --> 02:28:47.981
Oh God!

2234
02:28:52.981 --> 02:28:54.022
Good blow!

2235
02:28:57.022 --> 02:29:00.102
Great my tiger.

2236
02:29:00.102 --> 02:29:03.061
Crime master Gogo,
I'll make you bandmaster Toto.

2237
02:29:05.061 --> 02:29:06.221
Raveena and Karishma
take all the guns and..

2238
02:29:06.221 --> 02:29:07.102
..throw them in the gutter.

2239
02:29:08.102 --> 02:29:13.502
All of you give your guns
to the girls. No acting smart.

2240
02:29:13.502 --> 02:29:17.342
Otherwise I'll shoot the
brains of this nephew of Mogambo.

2241
02:29:18.342 --> 02:29:25.781
Gogo this pistol is not empty.
- Oh god! - Stand straight.

2242
02:29:35.781 --> 02:29:39.461
Catch them. Beat them.

2243
02:29:39.461 --> 02:29:41.582
Hey!

2244
02:29:52.582 --> 02:29:56.262
Leave them, sir.
Allow me. - With pleasure, Robert.

2245
02:29:59.262 --> 02:30:01.342
Oh god!

2246
02:30:03.342 --> 02:30:04.662
Excellent!

2247
02:30:10.662 --> 02:30:11.662
Excellent!

2248
02:30:13.662 --> 02:30:14.342
Oh god!

2249
02:30:15.342 --> 02:30:16.022
Excellent!

2250
02:30:22.022 --> 02:30:24.541
Sir.

2251
02:30:26.541 --> 02:30:27.102
Oh god!

2252
02:30:50.102 --> 02:30:52.502
Everyone is getting beaten. Run.

2253
02:33:04.502 --> 02:33:04.781
Hey!

2254
02:33:06.781 --> 02:33:08.422
Stop this drama.

2255
02:33:13.422 --> 02:33:16.621
Jokers, come to me with the diamonds.

2256
02:33:16.621 --> 02:33:18.781
Or else I will spread
the cards of these girls.

2257
02:33:20.781 --> 02:33:22.662
Take it out.

2258
02:33:29.662 --> 02:33:32.742
How much will these diamonds be worth?

2259
02:33:32.742 --> 02:33:34.182
Will it be worth a million?
- One million?

2260
02:33:35.182 --> 02:33:37.182
Each diamond will be worth a million.

2261
02:33:38.182 --> 02:33:41.262
Each diamond will be worth a million?

2262
02:33:41.262 --> 02:33:44.381
Yes, it is the life
long earning of uncle.

2263
02:33:44.381 --> 02:33:47.861
Uncle, see it for the last time.

2264
02:33:47.861 --> 02:33:49.182
Why are you showing it to him?
Come here.

2265
02:33:50.182 --> 02:33:55.342
If each one of them get
one diamond each then their..

2266
02:33:55.342 --> 02:33:59.502
..life will be made. - Why
only their life, the life of a few..

2267
02:33:59.502 --> 02:34:01.981
..generations will be made.
They will live like kings.

2268
02:34:01.981 --> 02:34:06.781
Bring it fast or I'll kill them.
- I'm bringing it.

2269
02:34:07.781 --> 02:34:12.381
Gogo, you also see.
It will be added to your stories.

2270
02:34:12.381 --> 02:34:15.342
You got it but couldn't enjoy it.
Don't touch it.

2271
02:34:15.342 --> 02:34:15.822
Just one. - Non.

2272
02:34:16.822 --> 02:34:19.141
I have lent money to Teja.
For that give me one.

2273
02:34:20.141 --> 02:34:22.502
Come here fast or I'll stab them.

2274
02:34:22.502 --> 02:34:27.221
I'm being careful.
- Be careful, don't drop them.

2275
02:34:30.221 --> 02:34:31.541
Non.

2276
02:34:32.541 --> 02:34:34.662
Move.

2277
02:34:38.662 --> 02:34:41.262
At least let me take one.
I am crime master Gogo.

2278
02:34:43.262 --> 02:34:45.221
Crime master Gogo.

2279
02:34:47.221 --> 02:34:50.141
Raveena's mother, I'm coming.

2280
02:34:55.141 --> 02:34:56.102
Hey move!

2281
02:34:57.102 --> 02:34:59.061
Give one to crime master Gogo.

2282
02:35:01.061 --> 02:35:02.182
Crime master Gogo.

2283
02:35:06.182 --> 02:35:07.422
He has taken it all.

2284
02:35:07.422 --> 02:35:10.342
Where? - There, catch them.

2285
02:35:12.342 --> 02:35:15.102
He also beat me.
Everyone is beating me.

2286
02:35:19.102 --> 02:35:21.022
Daddy! What happened to daddy?

2287
02:35:22.022 --> 02:35:24.541
What happened to you, daddy?

2288
02:35:24.541 --> 02:35:29.941
Uncle, get up.
See we staked our life and saved you.

2289
02:35:29.941 --> 02:35:34.262
What did you save?
They took away my life long earnings.

2290
02:35:34.262 --> 02:35:35.301
Nonsense.

2291
02:35:35.301 --> 02:35:38.662
How can they take
it away when we are here?

2292
02:35:38.662 --> 02:35:40.981
Prem take out the real diamonds.
- Here I take it out.

2293
02:35:40.981 --> 02:35:41.902
What?

2294
02:35:41.902 --> 02:35:44.582
Amar, we threw the real ones.

2295
02:35:44.582 --> 02:35:49.342
What are you talking?
Take out the bag of the fake ones.

2296
02:35:52.342 --> 02:35:54.621
No, we had kept the
real ones in a red bag.

2297
02:35:54.621 --> 02:35:54.061
Really? - Yes.

2298
02:35:57.061 --> 02:35:58.621
No, Prem. - What happened?

2299
02:35:59.621 --> 02:36:02.902
Yes, we had kept the
real ones in the red bag.

2300
02:36:02.902 --> 02:36:05.061
The real ones in the red bag.
This is the real one

2301
02:36:06.061 --> 02:36:08.742
I knew it.
I knew that my daughters will ..

2302
02:36:08.742 --> 02:36:11.061
..choose the real diamonds.

2303
02:36:13.061 --> 02:36:18.022
Listen, the people of the world.
My name is Mr. Gogo.

2304
02:36:24.022 --> 02:36:27.861
You may be some Gogo.
I lay the cards and you win the game?

2305
02:36:28.861 --> 02:36:30.861
Give me the diamonds.

2306
02:36:37.861 --> 02:36:43.301
..give me the diamonds.
- Bhalla! - Yes, give them to me.

2307
02:36:43.301 --> 02:36:47.221
Sorry sir.
- Robert! - Give me the diamonds.

2308
02:36:47.221 --> 02:36:49.781
This time there will be no mistake.

2309
02:36:49.781 --> 02:36:52.022
Now my life is made.
Thank you everybody.

2310
02:36:55.022 --> 02:36:56.461
No one will move.

2311
02:37:04.461 --> 02:37:05.981
Again I made the mistake.

2312
02:37:07.981 --> 02:37:09.381
Put them in a queue.

2313
02:37:10.381 --> 02:37:12.301
They are all in a queue.

2314
02:37:14.301 --> 02:37:18.262
Show me your face.
